### Environment Variables

| Variable | Default | Purpose |
|----------|---------|---------|
| `OLLAMA_CHAT_MODEL` | `llama3.2:1b` | Chat model |
| `OLLAMA_EMBED_MODEL` | `nomic-embed-text` | Embedding model |
| `OLLAMA_BYPASS` | `false` | Skip Ollama calls |
| `OLLAMA_NUM_PARALLEL` | `1` | Max concurrent Ollama requests |
| `OLLAMA_MEASURED_TOK_PER_SEC` | `9.0` | Measured tok/s for timeout math |
| `OLLAMA_TIMEOUT_BUFFER` | `1.5` | Multiplier for timeout calculation |
| `OLLAMA_CIRCUIT_THRESHOLD` | `3` | Failures before circuit opens |
| `OLLAMA_CIRCUIT_COOLDOWN` | `60` | Seconds before circuit closes |
| `RESPONSE_CACHE_TTL` | `300` | Cache TTL in seconds |
